sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Review before source changes
  accDescr: The assistant proposes a change to a reviewer. The reviewer approves the change before the workspace applies it.
  participant A as Assistant
  participant R as Reviewer
  participant W as Workspace
  A->>R: Propose change
  R->>W: Approve change
  W-->>R: Applied
